{"id":"nce1-109","book":"nce1","numbers":[109,110],"label":"Lesson 109–110","titleEn":"A Good Idea","titleCn":"个好主意","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/109.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.27,"en":"A good idea","cn":"一个好主意"},{"t":6.16,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听录音，然后回答这个问题："},{"t":11.67,"en":"What does Jane have with her coffee?","cn":"简喝咖啡时带了什么？"},{"t":16.97,"en":"Shall I make some coffee, Jane?","cn":"“我给你煮点咖啡吧，简？”"},{"t":21.76,"en":"That's a good idea, Charlotte.","cn":"“那是个好主意，夏洛特。”"},{"t":26.07,"en":"It's ready.","cn":"“咖啡煮好了。”"},{"t":27.97,"en":"Do you want any milk?","cn":"“你要加牛奶吗？”"},{"t":30.94,"en":"Just a little, please.","cn":"“请加一点点。”"},{"t":34.43,"en":"What about some sugar?","cn":"“那加点糖怎么样？”"},{"t":37.46,"en":"Two teaspoonfuls?","cn":"“两茶匙？”"},{"t":40.68,"en":"No, less than that.","cn":"“不，少一点就好。”"},{"t":43.63,"en":"One and a half teaspoonfuls, please.","cn":"请给我一茶半茶匙的量。"},{"t":48.29,"en":"That's enough for me.","cn":"对我来说，这就够了。"},{"t":52.03,"en":"That was very nice.","cn":"那真是太好了。"},{"t":55.25,"en":"Would you like some more?","cn":"您还要再来一些吗？"},{"t":58.05,"en":"Yes, please.","cn":"好的，请告诉我您需要翻译的内容吧。"},{"t":61.4,"en":"I'd like a cigarette, too.","cn":"我也想抽根烟。"},{"t":64.85,"en":"May I have one?","cn":"我可以要一个吗？"},{"t":67.5,"en":"Of course.","cn":"当然。"},{"t":69.46,"en":"I think there are a few in that box.","cn":"我觉得那个盒子里有几件东西。"},{"t":74.67,"en":"I'm afraid it's empty.","cn":"恐怕它是空的。"},{"t":78.18,"en":"What a pity!","cn":"真遗憾！"},{"t":80.5,"en":"It doesn't matter.","cn":"没关系。"},{"t":83.23,"en":"Have a biscuit instead.","cn":"“那就吃块饼干吧。”"},{"t":86.22,"en":"Eat more and smoke less!","cn":"“多吃点，少抽烟！”"},{"t":90.32,"en":"That's very good advice!","cn":"这真是很好的建议！"}],"words":[{"word":"idea","phonetic":["ai'diə"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"主意","us":"media/words/nce1/w0721_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0721_e.mp3"},{"word":"a little","phonetic":[],"pos":"","meaning":"少许(用于不可数名词之前)","us":"media/words/nce1/w0722_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0722_e.mp3"},{"w